{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101764","id":2285730762,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IPXvK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101764","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101764.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101764.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101764","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101764/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101764/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101764/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9ffac2adbc810c158fef8d7ba861f8e203ff8950","number":101764,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `Translation` loading order on startup","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nFixes #101073, fixes #103460, and fixes #116206. I moved the loading order to be after the `ScriptServer.init`. This may or may not introduce bugs relating to `Translation`s so some further testing might be required. I am not well-acquainted with the main loading process, so I probably missed some things.\r\n\r\nWhen loaded in the `ProjectSettings`, any class that extended `Translation` would crash the editor/project because the `TextServer` that is used in `GDScriptParser::parse_identifier` and the `ScriptServer` that handles global classes were not loaded yet. Additionally, text `Translation`s would not load since the `ResourceFormatLoaderText` was not loaded yet. Therefore, I think the loading order of `TranslationServer`-related tasks should be moved after the global classes are set up.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at"